      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2f8704775d158d0e",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.1 Pro 来了，助你应对复杂任务。升级后的核心智能能力正逐步上线，覆盖面向消费者和开发者的产品。你可以通过 Gemini API、Vertex AI、Gemini 应用和 NotebookLM 使用 3.1 Pro。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6b43a10482221e5d",
      "translationZh": "摘要由 Google AI 生成。生成式 AI 尚处于实验阶段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a9cbf9851ddc4dac",
      "translationZh": "《Gemini 3.1 Pro：以更智能的模型应对你最复杂的任务》介绍了 Google 升级后的 AI 模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a51f2b2fe376129b",
      "translationZh": "Gemini 3.1 Pro 正通过多个平台逐步向开发者、企业和消费者推出。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9c1464661bc59f43",
      "translationZh": "这款新模型的推理能力有所提升，在复杂问题求解基准测试中的得分显著更高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "63ee86eea78528d8",
      "translationZh": "它专为需要高级推理的任务而设计，例如综合数据或解释复杂主题。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "72c18b6f9565ee48",
      "translationZh": "Google 正在以预览版形式发布 3.1 Pro，以验证更新并进一步推进智能体工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f344ef9188695765",
      "translationZh": "探索其他风格：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3067d4d78ff0a729",
      "translationZh": "上周，我们对 Gemini 3 Deep Think 进行了重大更新，以解决科学、研究和工程领域的现代挑战。今天，我们正在发布实现这些突破的升级版核心智能：Gemini 3.1 Pro。我们正在面向消费者和开发者的各类产品中推出 3.1 Pro，将这一智能进步带入你的日常应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "23939f345cd4fb14",
      "translationZh": "从今天起，3.1 Pro 将陆续推出：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c172a2ebd1ef146f",
      "translationZh": "面向开发者，通过 Google AI Studio 中的 Gemini API、Gemini CLI、我们的智能体开发平台 Google Antigravity 以及 Android Studio 提供预览版",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3b5b1fb9aa70f555",
      "translationZh": "面向企业，在 Vertex AI 和 Gemini Enterprise 中提供",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
